    "sections": {
        "description": "bBlocks is a fast, lightweight block theme for building any website with the WordPress Site Editor — no page builder needed. Import one of 23 one-click starter sites for a business, agency, restaurant, clinic, school, real estate agency, blog or WooCommerce store, then make it yours with 150+ patterns, 22 style variations and ready-made headers and footers. Built entirely with core blocks, bBlocks is accessible, SEO-friendly, translation-ready and fully compatible with WooCommerce."
